<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian First Aluminium half-yr profits up.</title>
<headline>Nigerian First Aluminium half-yr profits up.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half-year results for First Aluminium Nigeria Plc, manufacturers of aluminium products, to end-June 1997.</p>
<p>(In million naira)</p>
<p>				 1997	1996</p>
<p> Turnover		   954.7	803.6</p>
<p> Profit before taxation  55.1	 35.5</p>
<p> Taxation		    17.6	 11.3</p>
<p> Profit after taxation   37.4	 24.1</p>
<p>($1=83 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
